    "title": "Severe Thunderstorm Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here SVRBIS The National Weather Service in Bismarck has issued a * Severe Thunderstorm Warning for... Northeastern Wells County in south central North Dakota... * Until 1045 PM CDT. * At 958 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located 12 miles northwest of New Rockford, or 24 miles northwest of Carrington, moving southeast at 15 mph. HAZARD...Ping pong ball size hail and 60 mph wind gusts. SOURCE...Radar indicated. IMPACT...People and animals outdoors will be injured. Expect hail damage to roofs, siding, windows, and vehicles. Expect wind damage to roofs, siding, and trees. * Locations impacted include... Bremen.",
